                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "44e8092a-f0bb-3f95-bc46-c5f3c78cba8e",
                        "entry_id": "00561052-e8d0-32c6-9321-66b65dba3c0d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "constitutional order (legal system defined by the constitution)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "feminine"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "9bc10ac7-3f60-4edd-9628-01ef014a6962",
                                "sense_id": "44e8092a-f0bb-3f95-bc46-c5f3c78cba8e",
                                "text": "Der Konstitutionalismus stellt im europäisch-amerikanischen Kontext eine politische Selbstverständlichkeit dar. Darob gerät jedoch schnell in Vergessenheit, dass der politischen Etablierung von Verfassungsordnungen oft ein zähes Ringen mit religiösen Vorstellungen der politischen Ordnung vorangegangen ist.",
                                "translation": "Constitutionalism is a political matter of course in the European-American context. However, it quickly falls into oblivion that the political establishment of constitutional orders has often been preceded by a tough struggle with religious ideas of the political order.",
                                "english": "Constitutionalism is a political matter of course in the European-American context. However, it quickly falls into oblivion that the political establishment of constitutional orders has often been preceded by a tough struggle with religious ideas of the political order."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fa061ce5-9659-44d9-940a-b221d5acd935",
                                "sense_id": "44e8092a-f0bb-3f95-bc46-c5f3c78cba8e",
                                "text": "Zu unserer Verfassungsordnung gehören das allgemeine Freiheitsrecht, das Grundrecht auf die freie Entfaltung der Persönlichkeit, der allgemeine Gleichheitsgrundsatz und die Religionsfreiheit.",
                                "translation": "Our constitutional order includes the general right to freedom, the fundamental right to free development of personality, the general principle of equality and freedom of religion.",
                                "english": "Our constitutional order includes the general right to freedom, the fundamental right to free development of personality, the general principle of equality and freedom of religion."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1171f319-87b9-45a3-b6be-3a3b2cafd914",
                                "sense_id": "44e8092a-f0bb-3f95-bc46-c5f3c78cba8e",
                                "text": "Eddie Chu sieht sich zwischen beiden Positionen: „Wir müssen über ein Referendum, das alle Möglichkeiten offenlässt, zu einer neuen Verfassungsordnung finden. Die Identität Hongkongs ist vielfältig, denn wir alle kommen aus verschiedenen Einwanderungsschichten.“",
                                "translation": "Eddie Chu sees himself between these two positions: “We have to find a new constitutional order through a referendum that leaves all possibilities open. Hong Kong’s identity is diverse, because we all come from different strata of immigration.”",
                                "english": "Eddie Chu sees himself between these two positions: “We have to find a new constitutional order through a referendum that leaves all possibilities open. Hong Kong’s identity is diverse, because we all come from different strata of immigration.”"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "940577e3-33ec-4bd4-810f-c59128b269f1",
                                "sense_id": "44e8092a-f0bb-3f95-bc46-c5f3c78cba8e",
                                "text": "Dass der menschliche Körper prinzipiell keine Sache sei, ist in einigen klassischen Verfassungsordnungen ausdrücklich festgelegt, beispielsweise in Frankreich: Der französischen Rechtsprechung zufolge begrenzt das Prinzip der »Unverfügbarkeit des menschlichen Körpers« die Selbstbestimmung des Individuums.",
                                "translation": "The fact that the human body is in principle not a thing is explicitly stated in some conventional constitutional orders, for example in France: According to French case law, the principle of “unavailability of the human body” limits the self-determination of the individual.",
                                "english": "The fact that the human body is in principle not a thing is explicitly stated in some conventional constitutional orders, for example in France: According to French case law, the principle of “unavailability of the human body” limits the self-determination of the individual."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
